      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://www.edushastra.com/our-faculty-2/" class="glass rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-base font-medium text-white">CAT 100%ilers as faculty</a>
        <a href="https://www.edushastra.com/ability-based-model/" class="glass rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-base font-medium text-white">Lifetime validity</a>
        <a href="https://www.edushastra.com/money-back-promise/" class="glass rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-base font-medium text-white">+99%ile or fee refund promise</a>
      </div>
      <a href="#courses" class="btn inline-block font-semibold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full">Choose your course</a>
