      <img src="https://www.edushastra.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Apex-final-e1774841680687.webp" alt="EduShastra Apex batch for CAT coaching" class="w-full object-cover rounded-3xl border border-white/10" width="800" height="600" />
      <div class="glass-gold rounded-2xl p-5 mt-6">
        <p class="font-display font-700 text-white">Next batch: {nextBatch}</p>
        <p class="text-ink-200 text-sm mt-1">Weekday and weekend options.</p>
