</header>

<main>
<section id="personalized-learning" class="py-7 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto glass rounded-3xl p-3 md:p-10">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-800 text-white text-center">Adaptive course path and <span class="text-brand-500">personalized learning</span></h2>
    <p class="text-ink-200 leading-relaxed mt-2 text-lg">All our CAT coaching courses follow an <strong class="text-white">adaptive course path</strong>. We don’t only customize the course, we personalize the learning experience for every student.</p>
     <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-white mt-7 mb-2">Evaluate &amp; Design model</h3>
    <p class="text-ink-200 leading-relaxed mt-2">Every course is split into four phases and adapts to your performance in the evaluation tests, so you reach your optimal level.</p>
    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-white mt-7 mb-2">Four-phase course structure</h3>
    <p class="text-ink-200 leading-relaxed mt-2">The <strong class="text-white">mapping phase</strong> starts with a profile evaluation and an IQ-based Mapping Test that places you in one of five groups. The <strong class="text-white">foundation phase</strong> covers the basics of all four sections, with weekly tests that adjust your path. The <strong class="text-white">testing phase</strong> brings computer adaptive, computer based and paper based tests. The <strong class="text-white">control phase</strong> closes any remaining gaps.</p>
    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-white mt-7 mb-2">Five groups, small batches</h3>
    <p class="text-ink-200 leading-relaxed mt-2">The five groups, called series, run from 6 to 10. The 6-series moves slowest with more concept-based classes, and higher series move faster with more application and practice. Batches are kept small so teachers can help you individually.</p>
    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-white mt-7 mb-2">Weekly course correction</h3>
    <p class="text-ink-200 leading-relaxed mt-2">The panel head reviews your weekly test performance and decides your next course path. In the testing phase, tests reach your portal one at a time, and each result sets the difficulty of the next.</p>
    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-700 text-white mt-7 mb-2">Ability-based model</h3>
    <p class="text-ink-200 leading-relaxed mt-2">Your ability, not the clock, decides when the course ends. If you haven’t reached your optimal level, the course repeats. One cycle is about 3.5 months for CAT.</p>
  </div>
</section>
 

<!-- SUCCESS STORIES -->
<section id="success-stories" class="py-8 px-6" aria-labelledby="success-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="reveal mb-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-brand-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Real Results</p>
      <h2 id="success-heading" class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-800 text-white">Success Stories</h2>
    </div>
    {stories.map(([label, ids, title]) => (
      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="reveal font-display font-700 text-brand-400 text-2xl mb-5">{label}</h3>
        <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 list-none p-0 m-0">
          {ids.map((id, i) => (
            <li class="reveal glass lift rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
              <div class="aspect-video bg-ink-800 relative">
                <button type="button" class="yt w-full h-full relative block" data-id={id} data-title={`${title} ${i+1}`} aria-label={`Play video: ${title} ${i+1}`}>
                  <img src={`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${id}/hqdefault.jpg`} alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                  <span class="yt-play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faculty" class="py-14 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
